### Fichier d'exploration de l'API (extension « REST Client » de VS Code, ou client HTTP de JetBrains).
### Lancez d'abord :  uvicorn api.main:app --reload
@base = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Santé : l'API répond-elle, quels modèles sont chargés ?
GET {{base}}/sante

### 2. Prévision : 4 relevés consécutifs (14 mars 2025, de 6 h à 9 h UTC) → température prévue à 12 h
POST {{base}}/predict/temperature
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releves": [
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T06:00:00Z", "temperature": -0.2, "humidite": 95, "pression_atmospherique": 996.7, "vent_vitesse": 1.4, "vent_direction": 17, "rafale_max": 3.8, "precipitation": 0.0, "pluie_cumul": 2629.2, "luminosite": 0, "indice_uv": 0.0},
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T07:00:00Z", "temperature": -0.3, "humidite": 95, "pression_atmospherique": 996.4, "vent_vitesse": 1.8, "vent_direction": 22, "rafale_max": 3.3, "precipitation": 0.0, "pluie_cumul": 2629.2, "luminosite": 2880, "indice_uv": 0.2},
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T08:00:00Z", "temperature": 0.2, "humidite": 92, "pression_atmospherique": 997.4, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 31, "rafale_max": 5.8, "precipitation": 0.0, "pluie_cumul": 2629.2, "luminosite": 13440, "indice_uv": 1.0},
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T09:00:00Z", "temperature": 3.3, "humidite": 82, "pression_atmospherique": 997.9, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 43, "rafale_max": 6.1, "precipitation": 0.0, "pluie_cumul": 2629.2, "luminosite": 24360, "indice_uv": 1.8}
  ]
}

### 3. Prévision, erreur : seulement 3 relevés → 422
POST {{base}}/predict/temperature
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releves": [
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T07:00:00Z", "temperature": -0.3, "humidite": 95, "pression_atmospherique": 996.4, "vent_vitesse": 1.8, "vent_direction": 22, "rafale_max": 3.3, "precipitation": 0.0, "luminosite": 2880, "indice_uv": 0.2},
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T08:00:00Z", "temperature": 0.2, "humidite": 92, "pression_atmospherique": 997.4, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 31, "rafale_max": 5.8, "precipitation": 0.0, "luminosite": 13440, "indice_uv": 1.0},
    {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T09:00:00Z", "temperature": 3.3, "humidite": 82, "pression_atmospherique": 997.9, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 43, "rafale_max": 6.1, "precipitation": 0.0, "luminosite": 24360, "indice_uv": 1.8}
  ]
}

### 4. Catégorie : un relevé → état du ciel (501 tant que l'atelier 4 n'est pas fait)
POST {{base}}/classify/conditions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releve": {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T09:00:00Z", "temperature": 3.3, "humidite": 82, "pression_atmospherique": 997.9, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 43, "rafale_max": 6.1, "precipitation": 0.0, "pluie_cumul": 2629.2, "luminosite": 24360, "indice_uv": 1.8}
}

### 5. Catégorie, erreur : humidité à 150 % → 422
POST {{base}}/classify/conditions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "releve": {"instant_mesure": "2025-03-14T09:00:00Z", "temperature": 3.3, "humidite": 150, "pression_atmospherique": 997.9, "vent_vitesse": 3.3, "vent_direction": 43, "rafale_max": 6.1, "precipitation": 0.0, "luminosite": 24360, "indice_uv": 1.8}
}
